{"c":[{"name":"20261002T160237Z-6009f034277d69a2","text":"Pending watch: a finished job's status text and its vanishing progress bar arrive in separate snapshots; without the trailing debounce the first Jev answer is about a half-changed window and is stale.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T160237Z-ba6e47628dfc0d66","text":"Eval scripts: never execFileSync in a polling loop. lsappinfo every 100 ms held the in-process helper's event loop and added 150-250 ms to every measured latency (B4).","type":"note"}]}
